Cell["\<\
The following functions calculate the absolute residual error of the \
numerical wavepacket\[CloseCurlyQuote]s parameters as a function of time, \
which are then plotted below.  Comparing the exact analytical solution \
against the numerical integrator over five harmonic periods reveals a clear \
hierarchy in how numerical truncation errors accumulate across the six \
wavepacket parameters, while demonstrating a dramatic six-to-seven \
order-of-magnitude accuracy improvement when increasing the working precision \
to thirty digits. Because the classical position and momentum centers obey \
smooth, strictly linear equations of motion, they exhibit the smallest \
overall residuals\[LongDash]fluctuating without a net upward trend in machine \
precision while showing only a tiny, steady phase drift at high precision. By \
contrast, the real width and imaginary chirp parameters are governed by \
coupled, nonlinear equations that oscillate at twice the trap frequency, \
causing their residuals to set the dominant error scale and grow steadily \
over time in both precision regimes. Finally, because the global action phase \
and normalization parameters directly integrate the width and chirp over \
time, their errors grow in lockstep with the shape parameters. Together, \
these trends offer rich opportunities for deeper numerical exploration\
\[LongDash]such as benchmarking symplectic and implicit Runge\[Dash]Kutta \
integration schemes, investigating long-time secular phase drift, and \
analyzing how adaptive step-size controllers couple linear and nonlinear \
subsystems.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001282386691544*^9, 4.001282437928076*^9}, {
  4.001286154786543*^9, 4.0012861730835752`*^9}, {4.001287245470399*^9, 
  4.001287245850051*^9}, {4.001287280661387*^9, 4.001287281121377*^9}, {
  4.00169042135317*^9, 4.001690423953555*^9}, {4.0016918863162317`*^9, 
  4.001691887124215*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6efcf62b-bff9-4827-9a31-\
8e19e9627e88"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "Define", " ", "absolute", " ", "residual", " ", "functions", " ", "for", " ",
     "each", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "six", " ", "parameters"}], " ", 
   "*)"}], 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"errRA", "[", "t_", "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"objExact", "[", "\"\<RA\>\"", "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}], "-", 
         
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"objNumMach", "[", "\"\<RA\>\"", "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}]}], 
        "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"objExact", "[", "\"\<RA\>\"", "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}], "-", 
         
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"objNumPrec30", "[", "\"\<RA\>\"", "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}]}],
         "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"errIA", "[", "t_", "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
