   4.0015998334243526`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"741858f1-9df1-4bd4-9bb8-\
89b90ccf7a9a"],

Cell["\<\
 Combining this with reversible Clausius entropy flux exported to the \
surroundings\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0015998820844107`*^9, 
  4.00159991052686*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"375041dc-d347-44b2-a11b-\
8e7173ef6e5f"],

