yields the instantaneous total entropy production rate of the universe\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001599947040909*^9, 
  4.001599964287035*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2b929779-23da-4717-986a-\
949200571e73"],

